    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69161006b1d6cefb68ea1141",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白阿尔丹突然往前倒了下去。\n我急忙扶住她，发现她虽然还有意识，\n但身体已经相当疲惫了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be5882dbac1e600040bb666720e761b0583ea00e7ec633a925e9b19515043e58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
