      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过保险起见，目白阿尔丹当天还是\n得住进目白家的疗养设施\n好好静养……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f5d92a166cfa4bb4ccb18f6655825ad89a5dda71b4219b7fac1130fe8da0755",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
